#: ui/k_mnu.cpp:453
msgid ""
"<p>You have chosen to open another desktop session."
"<br>The current session will be hidden and a new login screen will be "
"displayed."
"<br>An F-key is assigned to each session; F%1 is usually assigned to the first "
"session, F%2 to the second session and so on. You can switch between sessions "
"by pressing Ctrl, Alt and the appropriate F-key at the same time. Additionally, "
"the KDE Panel and Desktop menus have actions for switching between sessions.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Jy het gekies om oop te maak 'n ander werkskerm sessie."
"<br>Die huidige sessie sal weggesteek word en 'n nuwe inlog skerm sal vertoon word."
"<br>'n F-sleutel is ontwerp vir elke sessie; F%1 is gewoonlik ontwerp vir die eerste "
"sessie, F%2 vir die tweede sessie en so verder. Jy kan wissel tussen sessies "
"deur te druk Ctrl, Alt en die toepaslike F-sleutel op dieselfde tyd. Addisioneel, "
"die KDE Paneel en Werkskerm kieslyste het aksies vir wisseling tussen sessies.</p>"

